`COPY disk.tar.gz /tmp/` ... `mkdir -p /disk && tar -xzf disk.tar.gz -C /disk` ... `COPY sas-mock /sas`
So inside the Docker container built from `environment/Dockerfile`, `/disk` and `/sas` exist!
Let's test running `rewardkit` pointing to `/app/task/assets/disk` and `/app/task/environment/sas-mock` to see what happens when valid disk/sas paths are provided.",
